{"hymn":"S52","parent":"E66","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Cuán dulce el nombre de Jesús","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su nombre","syl":{"n1":"Cuán","n2":["dul","i"],"n3":["ce‿el","t"],"n5":["nom","i"],"n6":["bre","t"],"n8":"de","n9":["Je","i"],"n11":["sús","t"],"n12":"Al","n13":"fiel","n14":"en","n15":"su","n16":["do","i"],"n17":["lor!","t"],"n22":"Es","n24":["bál","i"],"n25":["sa","m"],"n26":["mo","t"],"n27":"en","n29":"su","n30":["vir","i"],"n31":["tud,","t"],"n32":"Que","n33":["cal","i"],"n34":["ma","t"],"n36":"su","n37":["te","i"],"n39":["mor.","t"],"n40":"Que","n41":["cal","i"],"n42":["ma","t"],"n43":"su","n45":["te","i"],"n47":["mor.","t"],"n51":"Que","n52":["cal","i"],"n53":["ma","t"],"n54":"su","n55":["te","i"],"n56":["mor.","t"],"n61":"Es","n63":["bál","i"],"n64":["sa","m"],"n65":["mo","t"],"n66":"en","n68":"su","n69":["vir","i"],"n70":["tud,","t"],"n71":"Que","n72":["cal","i"],"n73":["ma","t"],"n75":"su","n76":["te","i"],"n78":["mor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Puede al espíritu sanar","Y al pecho confortar;","Al alma hambrienta es maná,","Y al fatigado paz."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Tu dulce nombre Roca es,","Escudo y protección;","Como un tesoro lleno de","Tu gracia y bendición."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Jesús, Amigo, Salvador,","Profeta, Rey, Señor,","Camino, Vida, buen Pastor,","Acepta mi loor."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Aunque es muy débil mi vigor,","Y frió el corazón,","Mas cuando te vea, Señor,","Te alabaré mejor."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Hasta entonces se oirá","De Tu indecible amor,","Y por Tu nombre que triunfó","Se te dará loor."]}]}